{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/792196-wod-multiplayer-video-game","id":792196,"title":"WoD multiplayer video game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-24T08:41:15-08:00","id":792196,"title":"WoD multiplayer video game","content":"I am running a SA-MP WoD themed roleplay server.<br /> <br /> I won't say the server name as I don't want to sound like I am advertising but I was wondering if anyone has heard of it or perhaps even played there.<br /> <br /> I also wanted to ask if is there any section here where I am allowed to advertise.<br /> <br /> Regards,<br /> Rudy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10423-rudy23","name":"Rudy23","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10423_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T09:57:10-08:00","id":792235,"title":"","content":"Down in the conventions/online play area","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T22:59:43-08:00","id":792602,"title":"","content":"Intriguing. How does that work, exactly? I was watching some gameplay of a recent Grand car-taker game and wishing that all that sleazy-gangbanging had a supernatural component.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-25T01:49:57-08:00","id":792668,"title":"","content":"Well in order to play on my server you will need to install GTA: San Andreas, then San Andreas: Multiplayer Mod. Then you can connect to the server. To register an account you need to pass a RP test which consists of 10 question related to RP, server rules and the knowledge of English language. The RP quiz is there to filter the unwanted players with absolutely no RP knowledge as the questions are quite easy, e.g: &quot;What does OOC stand for?&quot;. Once you've registered you will start as human. In order to play as Vampire or Werewolf you will need to apply for the race which shouldn't be a problem for people with cWoD knowledge.<br /> <br /> As for the gameplay well it has nothing to do with the actual game GTA: San Andreas, the server is set in the mid 90's in Red County. One can become a cop, medic, fisherman, lumberjack, drug dealer, the options are endless. You get your paycheck every hour you spend in game. With the money you earn you can buy your character vehicles, houses, businesses, food, weapons a motel room, etc. . .<br /> <br /> There are OOC chats and IC chats. To start a RP with someone you can simply walk up to them and start a conversation in one of the IC chats. It is worth mentioning there is a dynamic character sheet system (You get Attribute/Ability/Virtue points when you level up; To level up you need to gain experience by spending time in game).<br /> <br /> I can go on forever describing the server. Feel free to ask questions if there is anything specifically you want me to explain.<br /> <br /> Regards,<br /> Rudy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10423-rudy23","name":"Rudy23","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10423_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-26T02:28:13-08:00","id":793030,"title":"","content":"Oh my god, yes. I've been raving about how World of Darkness that setting is. Do you have a forum for it? I crave all details.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-26T22:07:27-08:00","id":793427,"title":"","content":"I'm interested but skeptic, so for me it would also be good with a forum or site containing all the details. Or maybe some youtuber showing off! Either way, if it's executed well enough I would definitely get GTA:SA in order to play it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-27T02:05:16-08:00","id":793483,"title":"","content":"I am currently busy with developing the mod but I will be soon making a YouTube video for The Onyx Path community, explaining the gameplay. And we do have a <a href=\"http://vwh-rp.com\" target=\"_blank\">forum</a> (I will remove the link if I am not allowed to post URL's here). Note that there is no roleplay on this forum, everything is happening in game, live. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> EDIT: The forum is mainly for the players with registered game accounts but if you are planning to register make sure you put Onyx_Path as your IG-Name upon registration. I will tell my administrators to approve anyone who has put that as their IG name.<br /> <br /> Regards,<br /> Rudy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10423,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10423-rudy23","user":"Rudy23","date":". 12-27-2015, 05:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10423-rudy23","name":"Rudy23","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.co