,{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T06:08:37-08:00","id":827462,"title":"","content":"The storytelling system isn't easy to be adapted to videogames. Maybe a third world of darkness would be necesary for the videogames. <br /> <br /> What about vampires and daywalker creatures? Mabye we would need a server only for vampires PCs. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T03:33:15-08:00","id":828708,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/792196-wod-multiplayer-video-game?p=827462#post827462\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The storytelling system isn't easy to be adapted to videogames.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well we technically don't have a storytelling system. We rarely roll for anything else than combat but when we roll (Combat or special actions), the invovled parties usually storytell their own combat or actions and if an issue pops up they can use the &quot;/helpme&quot; command to request an administrator's assistance. In game administrators usually assume the role of the storyteller. (99% of the time there is an administrator online.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/792196-wod-multiplayer-video-game?p=827462#post827462\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe a third world of darkness would be necesary for the videogames.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am not sure what do you mean by that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/792196-wod-multiplayer-video-game?p=827462#post827462\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about vampires and daywalker creatures? Mabye we would need a server only for vampires PCs.</div> </div> </div> </div>The time mechanism and the sunlight sensitivity for the undead in game is specific. 1 hour in character (IC) lasts for 30 minutes in real life. The daytime is from 7:00 AM to 6:00 PM and if the weather is sunny, the Vampires lose Health Points while exposed to the sunlight (The lower their Generation is, the faster they lose HP). There is a mapped sewer and a mapped ancient underground town called Folnkirk:<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PM2tOHVyJks\" data-code=\"PM2tOHVyJks\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/PM2tOHVyJks/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iklQLpykhIE\" data-code=\"iklQLpykhIE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/iklQLpykhIE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10423-rudy23","name":"Rudy23","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10423_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T11:39:13-08:00","id":828890,"title":"","content":"I imagine the future of online videogames with a mixture of off and online game. How to explain it better? Let's imagine the offline way like to play an adult version of the sims, about housing, crafting, collecting... and the online version would be like the second life, most of times for &quot;adult actions&quot;, maybe with the option to hire a private server for &quot;XXX fun&quot; The players would pay for things could be used in the offline way.<br /> <br /> Other option for the future of the videogames are the NFC miniatures like Spyro: Skylanders, Disney Infinity and Nintendo Amiboo... but then maybe would see a version &quot;for children&quot; of Werewolf, Mage and Changeling... or a Exalted for children videogame.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T13:27:00-08:00","id":828934,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/792196-wod-multiplayer-video-game?p=828890#post828890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I imagine the future of online videogames with a mixture of off and online game. How to explain it better? Let's imagine the offline way like to play an adult version of the sims, about housing, crafting, collecting... and the online version would be like the second life, most of times for &quot;adult actions&quot;, maybe with the option to hire a private server for &quot;XXX fun&quot; The players would pay for things could be used in the offline way.<br /> <br /> Other option for the future of the videogames are the NFC miniatures like Spyro: Skylanders, Disney Infinity and Nintendo Amiboo... but then maybe would see a version &quot;for children&quot; of Werewolf, Mage and Changeling... or a Exalted for children videogame.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Well in my game we have a housing system (You can buy a house, furniture it, etc.), a job system (Become a farmer, fisherman, cop, drug dealer, etc.), a vehicle system (You can buy a car, bike, motorbike, truck, boat, etc.), an inventory system (Functional and roleplay items). You could say my game mode has Sims elements, yes.<br /> <br /> As for the erotic part you mentioned. There is a lot of players that practice E-RP (Erotic Role Play) which is a text based RP.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10423-rudy23","name":"Rudy23","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10423_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T14:34:36-08:00","id":828955,"title":"","content":"That chatbox look really small, does it ever become a problem with catching what people say in a crowded area?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T14:38:01-08:00","id":828956,"title":"","content":"The trouble about E-RP is about... sex with &quot;hobbits&quot;, to say it by the light way. When I played second life, I met people who.... like &quot;little hobbits&quot;. But in a WoD online videogame all charactes will be adult shape, will they be not?<br /> <br /> And now part of the future of videogames is a mixture of sandbox and housing, crafting, farm simulation, vehicle tunning.<br /> <br /> And I had fogorten about talk about the sponsorpay, maybe part of the future of videogames. When I played sims 3 (now I don't because I can't save games by &quot;error 12&quot;) there is a store to buy new things, and now with a &quot;sponsorpay&quot; you get free simpoints watching spots. Maybe the future of lots of free-to-play games will be the advertising to can buy videogame item.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":11152,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","user":"Luis Carlos","date":". 02-12-2016, 05:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-13T00:00:52-08:00","id":829153,"title":"","content":"I just presume people don't do ERP in public and keep it to themselves, as for what happens indoors well; it's best that stays in-doors whether or not it involves &quot;hobbits.&quot; At the end of the day it's a fictious video game, so long as you don't have to be exposed to it there is no harm in it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-13T01:06:10-08:00","id":829167,"title":"","content":"I agree about that, the ERP better for private in-door zones, better in private servers (would mods in private servers be allowed?). I worry about changeling: the dreaming game where some PCs may be children. For me a hobbit-like character is an adult with shorter shape, like a fantasy race (halflings, gnomes, goblins, dwarfs..) but a title like changeling may be a magnet for predators. And don't forget the flaw &quot;dwarf&quot;... what if anybody wants to play a Tirion Lannister-like character? For example a werewolf metis.<br /> <br /> * Have you readen anything about the new videogame &quot;Conan: the exiles&quot;? It is a off-line game but with online option. Maybe this is the future of videogames, to be played off-line but with multiplayer online option. <br /> <br /> * If there are videogames of WW titles, I guess maybe we will see exalted, scarrend lands and another WoD lines, like a previous playtesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","cu